{
  "_implementation_notes": [
    "ROCK TUNNEL AREA — Maps 154, 256, 349, 350, 351, 391, 495, 513.",
    "Tone: Dark, claustrophobic, physically grueling. Trainers are",
    "lost, stubborn, or half-mad from the dark. Hikers and spelunkers",
    "who chose to be here; trainers who didn't. Zubat hell. Some mention",
    "needing Flash. The Power Plant looms nearby — NPCs reference it.",
    "",
    "Map 154 (Route 10): Move tutors EV016/EV015/EV011 are MECHANICAL",
    "— preserved exactly. Trainer flavor lines rewritten. EV008 is a",
    "postgame NPC (switch 12+14) with unique flavor about the Power Plant.",
    "",
    "Map 256 (Gate): Wildlife signs EV001/EV002 rewritten for Synthesis",
    "tone. EV004 NPC flavor rewritten. EV005 Venonat trade is MECHANICAL",
    "— trade logic preserved, only intro/outro flavor touched. EV006",
    "Pokemon cry is MECHANICAL — preserved.",
    "",
    "Maps 349/350 (Rock Tunnel floors): Trainer pre-battle taunts and",
    "post-battle flavor rewritten. Egg gifts, drink trades, Flash trades,",
    "Pokedex reward, and Jigglyth/Sing trades are MECHANICAL — trade/gift",
    "logic and choice prompts preserved, only flavor framing touched.",
    "",
    "Map 351 (Route 9): EV002 jetpack waterfall quest is MECHANICAL",
    "— preserved exactly.",
    "",
    "Map 391 (Pokemon Center): Nurse Joy is MECHANICAL — preserved.",
    "NPC flavor lines (EV005, EV007, EV009) rewritten.",
    "",
    "Map 495 (Route 9): Trainer pre/post-battle flavor rewritten.",
    "Trade mechanics (EV005, EV010) are MECHANICAL — trade logic",
    "preserved, only flavor framing touched.",
    "",
    "Map 513 (Rock Tunnel): EV001 item gift is MECHANICAL — preserved.",
    "",
    "Line length limit: ~42 characters per line for RPG Maker XP."
  ],
  "maps": {
    "154": {
      "name": "Route 10",
      "events": {
        "7": {
          "name": "Trainer(3)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I keep coming back to Gyms",
                    "and losing. Every time.",
                    "Maybe the problem is me."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": { "self_switch": "A" },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "If I can't beat you, I can't",
                    "beat a Gym Leader either."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "One more round? I need to",
                    "know if I'm getting better."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "choices",
                  "choices": ["Yes", "No"]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 8,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Thank you. I mean it."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 18,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Fair enough. I'll train",
                    "out here a while longer."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "18": {
          "name": "Trainer(2)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Strategy is overrated.",
                    "Hit hard. Hit first. Done."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": { "self_switch": "A" },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Fine. You hit harder.",
                    "I respect that."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Let's have another battle!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "choices",
                  "choices": ["Yes", "No"]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 15,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Whatever. I'll be here",
                    "punching rocks."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "8": {
          "name": "",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": { "switch1_id": 12, "switch2_id": 14 },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You know those stones that",
                    "keep appearing near the",
                    "Power Plant?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I thought they were eggs at",
                    "first. Electric-type, maybe.",
                    "But they're... something else."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 7,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Strange magnetic pull. Like",
                    "the Plant is still running",
                    "on something we can't see."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 10,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Anyway — you look strong.",
                    "How about a match?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 12,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The Plant's been abandoned",
                    "for years, but the air around",
                    "it still crackles."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 15,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "One more round — meet me at",
                    "the Fighting Arena in",
                    "Vermilion!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 17,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Let's meet up at the",
                    "Fighting Arena in",
                    "Vermillion City!"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
